2026-11-28T04:08:00.5704727Z           package, please make sure that 'carr_library.language_qualification.data' is explicitly added
2026-11-28T04:08:00.5705200Z           to the `packages` configuration field.
2026-11-28T04:08:00.5705457Z   
2026-11-28T04:08:00.5705722Z           Alternatively, you can also rely on setuptools' discovery methods
2026-11-28T04:08:00.5706184Z           (for example by using `find_namespace_packages(...)`/`find_namespace:`
2026-11-28T04:08:00.5706567Z           instead of `find_packages(...)`/`find:`).
