2026-11-28T04:08:00.5708141Z   
2026-11-28T04:08:00.5708463Z           If you don't want 'carr_library.language_qualification.data' to be distributed and are
2026-11-28T04:08:00.5709043Z           already explicitly excluding 'carr_library.language_qualification.data' via
2026-11-28T04:08:00.5709552Z           `find_namespace_packages(...)/find_namespace` or `find_packages(...)/find`,
